# Generated docs are compared byte-for-byte by `generate-catalog.ts --check`.
# Without pinning the EOL here, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows checks them out
# with CRLF while the generator always writes LF, so --check reports every
# generated file as stale even though the content is identical. The diff is
# empty; only the line endings differ.
docs/** text eol=lf
